sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Client
  participant P1 as API
  participant P2 as Primary
  participant P3 as Replica
  P0->>P1: Create order
  P1->>P2: Commit write
  P2->>P1: Commit position
  P2-->>P3: Replication delayed
  P0->>P1: Read own new order
  P1->>P2: Freshness requires primary
  P2->>P1: Current order
  P1->>P0: Read-your-write result
